REQUIRE VERSION "1.15"
INCLUDE life_cell

# LIFE_CELL_GBA1 — GBA1 lysosomal acid beta-glucocerebrosidase after NEU1 on glycosphingolipid continuum
# Continuum ...->ugcg->b4galt->st3gal5->st8sia1->b4galnt1->b3galt4->st3gal2->st8sia5->st6galnac6->st6galnac5->neu3->glb1->hexa->neu1->gba1 (GBA1 after NEU1 lysosomal neuraminidase limb)
# Gift: GBA1 cleaves beta-glucose from GlcCer under ASSERT after NEU1 neuraminidase ward so free energy re-enters glucose/ceramide salvage without hollow GlcCer lock (Gaucher ward).
# Domain: post-NEU1 lysosomal GBA1 acid beta-glucocerebrosidase ward (catabolic GlcCer-hydrolase limb).
# Cube is SoT. Free energy must flow. Not a dual ladder.

ENTITY er OF Cell 1 44 0
ENTITY drop OF Cell 1 28 0
ENTITY ash OF Cell 0 18 0
ENTITY starve OF Cell 1 0 0
ENTITY nest OF Cell 1 52 0

SEND er set_threshold 10
SEND drop set_threshold 12
SEND nest set_threshold 8
SEND starve set_threshold 10

SEND er pulse 5
SEND er photosynth 42
SEND er glycolyse 34
SEND er pump 26
SEND er photophos 24
SEND er charge 38
SEND er feed 36
